Acceptance checklist:

- [ ] C3 grammar compiled in root, one implementation reused by the engine integration test; no uncompiled stray module or pinned-byte change.
- [ ] Exact v4 widths/enums/order, typed checked i64 entry point, strict padding policy recorded, singleton reserved fields, precise JSON omission/zero/EMPTY semantics.
